  <!--EN: This quest chain will have you explore several underground lab complexes created by the ancient military to try and create supersoldiers through something called archite injection. You may be able to retrieve valuable lab equipment for yourself, to eventually create your own super soldiers, horrible abominations, or both.-->
  <VQE_TheAncientLab.description>这个任务链将让你探索由古代军事创建的几个地下实验室综合体，尝试通过一种称为建筑注射的东西来创造超级士兵。你也许能够为自己找回有价值的实验室设备，最终创造出你自己的超级士兵、可怕的可憎之物，或者两者兼而有之。</VQE_TheAncientLab.description>
